 "<b style=\"font-size:25px;color:#d76135\">Meta</b><br><span style=\"font-size:20px;color:#0f3022\">10 km en la octava semana.</span>": "<b style=\"font-size:25px;color:#d76135\">Goal</b><br><span style=\"font-size:20px;color:#0f3022\">10 km in week eight.</span>",
